                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Did not work at all with my xbox controller, so I played on mouse and keyboard. Short, simple, easy, and doesn't waste time. The writing and voice acting is nauseatingly sweet and repetitive. The combat element is also very simple and forgiving. A lot of level design only comes into play once for the whole game. Expect to 100% in a few hours at most without a guide. There really isn't a lot going on here and it's not terribly well-polished, but I vibed with it.",
